WEBVTT

00:20:27.756 --> 00:20:30.676
that's what he tried to bring in,

00:20:30.716 --> 00:20:33.676
to increase infrastructure
and to improve it

00:20:33.676 --> 00:20:35.196
and crack down on corruption,

00:20:35.236 --> 00:20:38.396
because Ukraine did have,
and may still, after the war,

00:20:38.436 --> 00:20:40.036
have a corruption problem.

00:20:40.076 --> 00:20:42.956
But believe me, now,
that is right on the back burner.

00:20:42.996 --> 00:20:45.876
And US senators
of both parties have told me

00:20:45.916 --> 00:20:48.076
that everything
that the Americans are sending

00:20:48.076 --> 00:20:49.276
and NATO is sending

00:20:49.316 --> 00:20:50.516
is accounted for,

00:20:50.556 --> 00:20:53.836
and they are not worried about it
going into somebody’s pocket.

00:20:53.836 --> 00:20:55.156
Unlike in Russia,

00:20:55.156 --> 00:20:57.636
where it’s gone into,
obviously, people’s pockets

00:20:57.636 --> 00:21:00.356
because they have barely
a military machine